  "headline": {
    "id": "nvidia-rebellions-sk-telecom-inference-roadmap-20261109",
    "date": "2026-11-09",
    "title": "NVIDIA and Rebellions plan mixed GPU/NPU inference systems for SK Telecom in 2028",
    "summary": "At AI Day Seoul, NVIDIA, Rebellions and SK Telecom outlined R200 systems using NVLink Fusion and the MGX rack architecture, with deployment readiness expected in 2028. Their proposed split assigns prompt processing, or prefill, to NVIDIA GPUs and response generation, or decode, to Rebellions NPUs. SK Telecom plans to deploy the systems. No processor quantity, contract value or measured end-to-end performance is disclosed. Separately, NVIDIA released B200 deployment recipes for four Korean open models. That software release is distinct from future R200 hardware availability; it does not establish a new installed accelerator fleet.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "NVIDIA–Rebellions–SK Telecom release (page November 8; Seoul dateline November 9)",
        "url": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-rebellions-and-sk-telecom-announce-collaboration-to-advance-sovereign-ai-infrastructure-with-nvidia-nvlink-fusion",
        "date": "2026-11-08"
      },
